**Does NOT handle:**

- Navigation logic (use with router/navigation handlers)
- Form submission logic (handle in parent)
- Buttons with background/border (use `EtButton` instead)
- Icon-only buttons (use `EtButton` with a single `EtButton.Icon` child instead)

## Entry Points & Contracts

### `EtLink` (main component)

```tsx
<EtLink
  variant?: LinkVariant    // default: 'primary'
  size?: LinkSize          // default: 'medium'
  disabled?: boolean             // default: false
  haptics?: boolean              // default: true
  onPress?: (event) => void
  style?: StyleProp<ViewStyle>
  // ...other PressableProps
>
  {children}
</EtLink>
```

**Children constraints (enforced at runtime):**

- `string` - auto-wrapped in `EtLink.Label`
- `<EtLink.Label>` - text content
- `<EtLink.Icon>` - icon content
- Any other children will log an error in development mode

### `EtLink.Label`

```tsx
<EtLink.Label
  variant?: TextVariant      // auto-sized based on link size
  style?: StyleProp<TextStyle>
  numberOfLines?: number     // default: 1
>
  {string}
</EtLink.Label>
```

### `EtLink.Icon`

```tsx
<EtLink.Icon
  name: IconName             // required - icon from icon library
  appearance?: {
    size?: number            // auto-sized based on link size
    color?: string           // auto-colored based on variant
  }
/>
```

### Types

| Type               | Values                                  |
| ------------------ | --------------------------------------- |
| `LinkVariant`      | `'primary'` \| `'info'` \| `'negative'` |
| `LinkSize`         | `'small'` \| `'medium'` \| `'large'`    |
| `LinkIconPosition` | `'none'` \| `'leading'` \| `'trailing'` |

**Note:** `LinkIconPosition` is auto-detected based on children order:

- No icon = `'none'`
- Icon as first child = `'leading'`
- Icon after label = `'trailing'`

## Usage Patterns

### String shorthand (simplest)

```tsx
<EtLink onPress={handlePress}>Learn more</EtLink>
```

### Label with trailing icon

```tsx
<EtLink onPress={handlePress}>
  <EtLink.Label>View details</EtLink.Label>
  <EtLink.Icon name="chevronRight" />
</EtLink>
```

### Icon with leading position (order matters!)

```tsx
<EtLink onPress={handlePress} variant="info">
  <EtLink.Icon name="share" />
  <EtLink.Label>Open in browser</EtLink.Label>
</EtLink>
```

### Negative/Destructive action

```tsx
<EtLink variant="negative" onPress={handleDelete}>
  Remove item
</EtLink>
```

### Inline with text

```tsx
<View style={{ flexDirection: 'row', flexWrap: 'wrap', alignItems: 'center' }}>
  <EtText>By continuing, you agree to our </EtText>
  <EtLink size="medium" onPress={handleTerms}>
    Terms of Service
  </EtLink>
  <EtText>.</EtText>
</View>
```

### Disabled state

```tsx
<EtLink disabled onPress={handlePress}>
  Unavailable
</EtLink>
```

## Anti-patterns

### ❌ Passing arbitrary components as children

```tsx
// BAD - will throw runtime error
<EtLink>
  <View><Text>Custom content</Text></View>
</EtLink>

// BAD - don't use EtText directly, will throw runtime error
<EtLink>
  <EtText>Label</EtText>
</EtLink>
```

**Fix:** Use only `string`, `EtLink.Label`, or `EtLink.Icon` as children.

### ❌ Using EtLink for primary actions

```tsx
// BAD - use EtButton for primary actions
<EtLink>Submit</EtLink>
```

**Fix:** Use `EtButton` component for primary/prominent actions.

### ❌ Using EtLink for icon-only buttons

```tsx
// BAD - use EtButton with EtButton.Icon instead
<EtLink>
  <EtLink.Icon name="close" />
</EtLink>
```

**Fix:** Use `EtButton` with a single `EtButton.Icon` child for icon-only buttons.

### ❌ Manually styling colors

```tsx
// BAD - bypasses design system
<EtLink>
  <EtLink.Label style={{ color: 'blue' }}>Text</EtLink.Label>
</EtLink>
```

**Fix:** Use `variant` prop to control appearance.

## Dependencies & Edges

### Internal Dependencies

- `useEtoroTheme` - provides theme colors for variant styling
- `useLinkAnimation` - provides scale animation on press
- `EtText` - underlying text component for `LinkLabel`
- `EtoroIcon` - underlying icon component for `LinkIcon`
- `LinkContext` - React context for passing state to subcomponents

### External Dependencies

- `expo-haptics` - haptic feedback on press
- `react-native` - `Pressable`, `StyleSheet`
- `react-native-reanimated` - scale animation on press

### Design System Integration

- Colors come from theme (`useEtoroTheme().colors`) using V2 tokens:
  - Primary: `primary600` (default) → `primary500` (pressed)
  - Negative: `verdictNegative600` (default) → `verdictNegative500` (pressed)
  - Info: `carbon900` (default) → `carbon800` (pressed)
  - Disabled (all variants): `carbon300`
- Typography variants from `TextVariant` system
- Icon sizes based on link size (16, 20, 24)

## Patterns & Pitfalls

### Disabled blocks press

When `disabled={true}`, the link:

- Ignores `onPress` callbacks
- Shows disabled text color
- Has `accessibilityState={{ disabled: true }}`

### Haptic feedback

By default, haptic feedback is enabled. Disable only for rapid-fire actions:

```tsx
// OK - rapid toggle doesn't need haptics
<EtLink haptics={false} onPress={handleQuickToggle}>
  Toggle
</EtLink>
```

### Pressed state

The link provides visual feedback when pressed:

- **Scale animation**: Scales down to 0.95 on press, springs back to 1 on release
- **Color change**: Text changes to hover color variant
- Animation disabled when `disabled={true}`

